                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Tri-Motors Safety Airways/67:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-10T18:00:00-04:00">July 10, 1929—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>227. Your 324, July 8, 9 a.m. Flights referred to are for survey of proposed
                    airmail route.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
